    "created_at": "2019-04-04T13:27:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-04-04T13:27:23Z",
    "body": "Yeah.  The proposal will include a call to [Trusted Type's Get Trusted Type compliant string](https://wicg.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#abstract-opdef-get-trusted-type-compliant-string).\r\n\r\nThe plan was initially for Trusted Types to modify [html5/hostensurecancompilestrings](https://www.w3.org/TR/html5/webappapis#section-hostensurecancompilestrings) but may involve modifying [CSP/EnsureCSPDoesNotBlockStringCompilation](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP/#can-compile-strings)\r\n\r\nI'm rewriting the ]relevant part of TT](https://wicg.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#string-compilation) based on [wicg/trusted-types#144](https://github.com/WICG/trusted-types/issues/144).\r\n\r\n\r\n",
